@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #42566B
  LifeLineBorderColor #8295A8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #D8EAFE
  ActivationBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  ParticipantFontColor #172B4D
  ActorBorderColor #42566B
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #8295A8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  DividerBorderColor #8295A8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
hide footbox
title UC-P06 - Check In a Private EV
actor Student as ST
boundary "Student Portal" as UI
control "Parking Service" as SVC
entity "Mobility Records" as DATA

note over ST,DATA
  Preconditions: Student is signed in, has arrived at the Hub and has a reservation reference.
  Service calls use the signed-in Student's identity.
end note

ST -> UI: Check in private EV
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Get check-in context (reservationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Load owned reservation and existing parking session (studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Owned context / existing Active session / invalid or unavailable / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
SVC --> UI: Check-in context or existing result / explicit error
deactivate SVC
alt missing, not owned, Cancelled/Expired/Completed or retrieval failed
UI --> ST: Generic unavailable record / accessible invalid state / read error; no check-in
else check-in already completed with Active session
UI --> ST: Show existing Active session; no extra occupancy
else owned reservation allows arrival review
UI --> ST: Show reserved Hub, vehicle and parking interval
end
deactivate UI
break invalid or unreadable context, or check-in already completed
note over ST,DATA
  End this attempt; no new session or extra occupancy.
end note
end
ST -> UI: Confirm arrival details or decline
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student declines, edits or abandons
UI --> ST: Leave reservation and occupancy unchanged
else Student confirms
UI -> SVC: Confirm arrival (reservationRef, Hub, vehicle, operationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Recheck session and permission
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Current access result
deactivate SVC
alt session expired or permission denied
SVC -> SVC: Prepare authentication-required / access-denied result
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: No update attempted
deactivate SVC
else session valid and permission granted
critical Validate current reservation and record one check-in
SVC -> DATA: Check in if owned, matching vehicle/Hub, Confirmed,\nwithin configured check-in window and allocation can be honoured
activate DATA #E2E7ED
note over SVC,DATA
  If already checked in, return the existing Active session. Otherwise create ONE Active
  session with actual unrounded arrival and mark reservation Checked In together.
  Account occupancy against existing holds; keep capacity for the remaining reserved interval.
end note
DATA --> SVC: Active session / mismatch / too early / invalid state / capacity issue / failure
deactivate DATA
end
opt update outcome uncertain / response lost
SVC -> DATA: Find original check-in result (operationRef, studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Original result / still unknown
deactivate DATA
end
opt new or existing Active session confirmed
SVC -> DATA: Read current linked charging-request status
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Charging status / unavailable
deactivate DATA
end
end
SVC --> UI: Operation outcome and accessible current details
deactivate SVC
alt access invalid
UI --> ST: Sign in if permitted; reload current records and confirm again
else outcome still unknown
UI --> ST: Outcome unconfirmed; retain operationRef and resolve original result before retry
else save failed
UI --> ST: Report failure; no partial update; retry after reload and revalidation
else vehicle or Hub mismatch
UI --> ST: No check-in; review reserved vehicle and Hub before confirming again
else before permitted check-in window
UI --> ST: Show when check-in opens; preserve reservation
else reservation no longer permits check-in
UI --> ST: Show current accessible state; no new session
else reserved allocation cannot be honoured
UI --> ST: Preserve reservation; no extra occupancy; seek operational assistance
else new or existing Active session confirmed
UI --> ST: Show Active session, actual arrival and charging status (or status unavailable)
end
end
deactivate UI
note over ST,DATA
  Check-in does not imply charging has started.
  A charging-status read error after confirmed check-in does not undo the parking session.
end note

legend bottom left
  Thin rectangle: execution of a responsibility; nested rectangle: nested execution
  Solid arrow: request / action   |   Dashed arrow: returned result
  Activation ends before waiting for Student input. Read guards top to bottom.
  critical: required consistency boundary; updates are all-or-none as noted
endlegend
footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
